{"id":1046,"date":"2021-05-21T12:03:35","date_gmt":"2021-05-21T12:03:35","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/?post_type=rdrcnews&#038;p=1046"},"modified":"2021-05-21T16:04:07","modified_gmt":"2021-05-21T16:04:07","slug":"downtown-far-rockaway-artist-commissioning-program","status":"publish","type":"rdrcnews","link":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/rdrcnews\/downtown-far-rockaway-artist-commissioning-program\/","title":{"rendered":"Downtown Far Rockaway Storefront Improvement"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Downtown Far Rockaway Artist Commisioning Program<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Note: We are no longer accepting Panelist and Artists applications. We are only accepting applications for Businesses &amp; Property Owner. Apply <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1skTORrW4f54oaTpTYAM2y1KwtYH_8w7b\/view\">here<\/a><\/span>.<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/rockawaydevrevcorp\/photos\/pcb.854331868748727\/854331232082124\/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignleft wp-image-1130 \" src=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Flyer2-UPDATE-DFR-Storefront-Project.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"476\" height=\"476\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Flyer2-UPDATE-DFR-Storefront-Project.png 1080w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Flyer2-UPDATE-DFR-Storefront-Project-150x150.png 150w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Flyer2-UPDATE-DFR-Storefront-Project-300x300.png 300w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Flyer2-UPDATE-DFR-Storefront-Project-768x768.png 768w, https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/01\/Flyer2-UPDATE-DFR-Storefront-Project-1024x1024.png 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 476px) 100vw, 476px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #000080;\">DOWNTOWN FAR ROCKAWAY ARTISTS COMMISSIONING PROGRAM\/STOREFRONT IMPROVEMENT<\/span> <\/strong><\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">RDRC will subcontract with Queens Council on the Arts (QCA) to kickstart the launch of the Artist Commissioning Program (ACP), a democratized art commissioning project focused on placing artwork, designed by local artist on solid rolldown gates located in Downtown Far Rockaway. The project funded by <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www1.nyc.gov\/site\/sbs\/neighborhoods\/storefront-improvement.page#:~:text=The%20program%20reimburses%20up%20to,or%20before%20September%2030%2C%202020.\">New York City Department of Small Business Services (NYC SBS)<\/a><\/span>\u00a0 is a partnership with RDRC, QCA, designed for Downtown Far Rockaway businesses, property owners, and local artist&#8230;<span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1EuksUHajhhh7HnE3Jj7vIhWjvRgdFQ6X\/view?usp=sharing\">more<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Businesses\/Property Owners learn more <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1qRJohW2DuTCfDZIYPoGu4SvxLxQb4pTJ\/view?usp=sharing\">here<\/a><\/span>, <\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Community Panelist <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1BYq0JkdEU3MiAMjaRvlOUWdx6buLMNTv\/view?usp=sharing\">here<\/a><\/span>, and <\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">Artists <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/drive.google.com\/file\/d\/1mXbTbHUdW6K4TieUZpLw_XaY_Z0Se9e_\/view?usp=sharing\">here<\/a><\/span>.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><!--more--><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Storefront Improvement<span style=\"color: #000080;\">\u00a0<span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Program\u00a0<span style=\"color: #000080;\">essential to upgrading; enhancing and creating a well-designed storefront attracting customers; highlighting local businesses; defining the community and promoting a thriving neighborhood, bringing more visibility and identity to the character of Downtown Far Rockaway<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">Community Panelist <span style=\"color: #000080;\">experienced cultural professionals with a commitment to the development of the arts and culture in their Queens communty. Each QCA panelist has knowledge of Queens communities, and expertise in an artistic discipline, arts administration, or community arts programming.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">A<\/span><span style=\"color: #000080;\"><span style=\"color: #b87614;\">rtists<\/span> who present a fresh perspective by creating work that speaks to the cultural diversity of Downtown Far Rockaway Queens by bringing a more vibrant and welcoming feel to our Rockaway community.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">As the Rockaway community undergoes revitalization, along with challenges due to COVID-19, the community continues to grow, as does the need to further enhance the communities economic growth, thru neighborhood promotions, and economic resources for public improvements.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">The CBO&#8217;s website is the primary source of news in the Downtown Far Rockaway neighborhood. It provides information on community happenings, business opportunities, invitations, and information on our programs and services. Join our <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/visitor.r20.constantcontact.com\/manage\/optin?v=001f-KEXzn5tO1N9oJq961YEq-GzWV1xAIboWtxqYSZXpq5yO1UUgfaSniqtf1xswR-A8b9vOUVS7HXpQIU0guJvspmnPOyroO7_bzKHe449Dw%3D\">weekly electronic newsletter<\/a><\/span> for upcoming happenings and business resources, subscribers will also recieve periodic invites to special RDRC events.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000080;\">To learn more about our partner Queens Council on the Arts (QCA) click <span style=\"color: #b87614;\"><a style=\"color: #b87614;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.queenscouncilarts.org\">here<\/a><\/span><\/span>.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Downtown Far Rockaway Artist Commisioning Program Note: We are no longer accepting Panelist and Artists applications. We are only accepting applications for Businesses &amp; Property Owner. Apply here.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"featured_media":1131,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"class_list":["post-1046","rdrcnews","type-rdrcnews","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews\/1046","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/rdrcnews"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/rdrcnews"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/1131"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rdrc.org\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=1046"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}